SUPLINF.P:
• establishes that “food group,” for the purposes of the “healthy” claim, refers to the groups of foods recommended in the 
Dietary Guidelines, 2020-2025
 (for adults and children 2 years of age and older; available at 
https://www.dietaryguidelines.gov
), which are vegetables, fruits, dairy, grains, protein foods, as well as oils;
